Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=28}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.70,0:02:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You got somethin' you wanna\Nsay to me, you little brat?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.40,0:02:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:05.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I do. Give back Pops'\Ngold! Every bit of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.81,0:02:07.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.72,0:02:11.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean the junk we got\Nfrom old man Cricket?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:25.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NMaybe it's news to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that's what pirates do.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.93,0:02:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of looting?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what am I saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.56,0:02:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just a pathetic dreamer
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.23,0:02:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who can't open his\Neyes long enough
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get a good look\Nat the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWell, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If stealing is just\Nwhat we pirates do,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.61,0:02:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I should steal\Nthe gold back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:44.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKERS murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\N"100 Million Man!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.47,0:02:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's cute. But be serious,\Ncan you really fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you even know\Nhow to throw a punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.54,0:03:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NI saw your\Nfighting skills earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.71,0:03:04.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're very good at\Njust standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I was right.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.55,0:03:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're still hangin'\Non to that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear?\NIt's worthless. Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if this is the real thing,\Nthen Bellamy's in trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.31,0:03:18.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's good, but you have to\Nadmit, he can't beat someone
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with a hundred‐\Nmillion‐Berry bounty.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.65,0:03:21.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be joking.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.55,0:03:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at him. He's\Njust a little runt.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.16,0:03:25.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's probably not even\Nworth the trouble
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.62,0:03:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it would take to fight him.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just seeing him now\Nmakes me doubt
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.57,0:03:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that 30‐million‐Berry bounty.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.39,0:03:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Standing there isn't\Ngonna get the gold back.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.69,0:03:35.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? You freezing up\Nlike this afternoon?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.39,0:03:37.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Admit it: You're too\Nscared to fight me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.27,0:03:40.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This afternoon was\Ndifferent. I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that\Nreal soon, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.41,0:03:46.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of listening to you,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.01,0:03:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I think I'll shut you\Nup for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, this\Nwon't take long.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.62,0:03:58.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spring Sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:09.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a little boy\Nwho still believes in dreams.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.72,0:04:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You disgrace the rest of us\Nby calling yourself a pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.59,0:04:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to stop this foolish\Ndreaming and grow up.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let's end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:20.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NHe's headed right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN B]\NRun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like your dreams\Nare at an end.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.58,0:04:35.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN B]\NHe's alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know when\Nto quit, do you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine! Have it your way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.33,0:04:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're just getting\Nto the good part!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spring... Hopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.36,0:05:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the same kinda move\Nhe pulled to beat Roshio.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.36,0:05:02.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NSo you want the gold back, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because old man\NCricket's your friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.10,0:05:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a decrepit fool
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who spends all his time chasing\Nafter a 400‐year‐old lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's probably what\Nyou like about him, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.25,0:05:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You like to call yourselves\Npirates, but you know nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.28,0:05:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no city of gold,\Nno island in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.12,0:05:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just oceans and ships\Nand the men who sail them.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.19,0:05:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou asked if I know\Nhow to throw a punch.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just finish him so we\Ncan drink, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watching you beat him\Nsenseless has made me thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY'S CREW laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So long, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.30,0:06:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit messing around,\NBellamy, and get up.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.49,0:06:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The joke's over. We know that\Nrunt couldn't beat you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This really isn't funny\Nanymore! Now snap out of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.94,0:06:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to get up and\Nshow that kid who you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a real pirate,\Nnot like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your bounty's up to 55 million...\Nyou can't lose to some rookie!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[DRUNKARD]\NThose two together\Nare worth 160 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.07,0:06:41.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[DRUNKARD]\NTheir bounties are\Nhigher than yours, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Know what that means?\NYou're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY'S CREW gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see now? I told\Nyou it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now, Cricket's gold.\NGive it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKERS yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MONKEY CREW]\N– Fix the ship, Monkey Crew, fix the ship.\N– Fix the ship, Monkey Crew, fix the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.53,0:07:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MONKEY CREW]\N– Bang the nails, Monkey Crew, bang the nails.\N– Bang the nails, Monkey Crew, bang the nails.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.85,0:07:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MONKEY CREW]\N– Saw the wood, Monkey Crew, saw the wood.\N– Saw the wood, Monkey Crew, saw the wood.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, these guys are\Nmust be pretty tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were just beaten\Nunconscious
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.49,0:07:17.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and now they're here\Nfixing the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Either they're the\Nworld's fastest healers
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or Chopper's the\Nworld's best doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhy didn't you go with Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.31,0:07:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fight, don't fight. Go, don't\Ngo. Do this, no do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind already!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.61,0:07:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. You're scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys beat you\Nthe first time around.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.43,0:07:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.\NThey didn't beat us.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.30,0:07:42.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Refusing to fight doesn't\Nmean that we were afraid.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When there's no reason to fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.95,0:07:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the only way to win\Nis to stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. "Stand\Ndown." Real brave.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about\Nfighting! Just shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.37,0:07:53.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me to shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like it matters.\NYou never listen anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI know more...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGuys, come on. Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYeah! Be more\Ncareful with the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.28,0:08:02.28,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe're trying to fix\Nthe ship, not destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Seriously! Oh, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.79,0:08:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat wasn't too hard to find.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.29,0:08:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It‐It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could we lose?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey you, come back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid runt!\NI'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.99,0:08:27.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll get him! We won't be\Nbeaten by some pretend pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a real punch!\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.03,0:08:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where am I going?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.34,0:08:39.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:58.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NCaptain. Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NWhat?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.95,0:09:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NIs... Is this really the place?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.54,0:09:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The legendary cave place where\NCaptain John hid his treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The treasure he killed\Nso many innocents to get?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.74,0:09:14.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.66,0:09:15.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now look alive boys,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.75,0:09:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the treasure is near but\Nso is unspeakable danger.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you let your guard\Ndown even for a second,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then death will creep on you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.73,0:09:25.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what\Nkind of monsters will appear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or what vicious booby traps\Nawait to kill us all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.78,0:09:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOSS]\NC'mon, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Another fine day of\Ncarving out tunnels awaits us!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.78,0:09:36.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WORKERS]\N– Right‐O, Boss!\N– Right‐O, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.14,0:09:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. You must be the new\Nguys they sent down.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NNothing like working\Nup a sweat, right, Boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All a man really needs\Nis a pick axe in his hand
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and a tunnel to dig!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can say that again!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hard days work\Nis a wonderful thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.30,0:09:53.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And because of our good\Nold‐fashioned elbow grease,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,everyone who comes\Nto this tunnel will smile!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NIt's liberating!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nafter all this hard labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we outta head to the\NOl' Bilge Barge for a...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.23,0:10:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you make me\Nwork like one of your lackies!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.55,0:10:19.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not one single piece of treasure\Non that whole rotten island.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.13,0:10:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, you should really\Nwatch what you say Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.76,0:10:24.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing the\Ncaptain hates, it's being wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.51,0:10:26.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, can't you see\Nhow red he's gotten
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.56,0:10:27.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with all the embarrassment?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.97,0:10:31.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's nose is a\Nbig red embarrassment?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.89,0:10:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.27,0:10:37.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we do not\Nhave time for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.19,0:10:39.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we going to\Ndo about those Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are quickly becoming\Nthe new favorite pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.57,0:10:44.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a plan of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We let 'em go\Non their merry way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NWhat? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.03,0:10:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, before\Nan evil witch feasts
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.16,0:10:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,upon the flesh of children\Nthe first thing the she does
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.41,0:10:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is makes sure to fatten them up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.27,0:10:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understand me?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.27,0:11:00.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiots.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is why I'm Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.17,0:11:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, the bigger the bounty\Ngets on the Straw Hats...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.06,0:11:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.76,0:11:05.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a genius, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That way when\Nyou take them down,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.35,0:11:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the bounty on your\Nhead will get even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! Exactly!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.68,0:11:17.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NYou're amazing, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.17,0:11:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shall we throw a party\Nin honor of your brilliance?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NOh, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.91,0:11:25.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALVIDA]\NIs this really\Nthe time to be throwing a party?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.65,0:11:26.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, how can you plan on
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,beating Luffy\Nand the Straw Hat's
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you haven't the faintest\Nidea of where they are?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.70,0:11:32.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a\Nparty pooper, Alvida.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll find Luffy\Nwhen we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:37.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NIf you're looking for Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can tell you where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:40.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! You see?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This guy over here is going\Nto tell us where he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Problem solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on! Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NSorry for crashing your party,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I simply couldn't resist the\Ndelicious aromas of your feast.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Portgas D. Ace.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.66,0:11:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you can call me Ace.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, what are you\Ndoing here, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less\Nabout what your name is,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.38,0:12:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. Portgas D. Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.08,0:12:10.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, this guy is...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the Fire Fist.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain of the Whitebeard\NPirates Second Unit!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not Whitebeard's...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! So you know the old man?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:27.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NNo, I won't!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, this could\Nbe our only chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can take out Fire Fist\NAce of the Whitebeard Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.79,0:12:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll be famous!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.33,0:12:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.82,0:12:43.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember this, men,\Nand remember it good.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the most important\Nlesson you'll ever learn:
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with\Nthe Whitebeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.03,0:12:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is a\Nkiller born and bred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only man who could go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.25,0:12:56.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,toe‐to‐toe with Gold Roger,\Nthe King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.75,0:12:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is without a doubt\Nthe strongest pirate alive
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:00.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the person closest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:04.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to obtaining the greatest\Ntreasure of all, One Piece!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.19,0:13:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In other words, don't cross him!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.19,0:13:10.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we were able to kill\NFire Fist Ace while he sleeps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard would avenge\Nthe murder of one of his own
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.82,0:13:15.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with the fury\Nof a thunderstrorm!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How is it that you know so much?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.61,0:13:18.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pray tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.78,0:13:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.70,0:13:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I met that man face to face, and\NI've never been the same since.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE snorts]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.27,0:13:32.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.\NI must've dozed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:34.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the? He's awake?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.73,0:13:40.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hey, hey! Why the long faces, everyone?\NI thought this was a party? Am I right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.61,0:13:41.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Men, commence having fun again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace, you sure know how\Nto have a good time!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ACE]\NWhoa! You guys got a lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be a good kitty and jump through\Nthat flaming hoop on two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NC'mon, Rich!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show him your stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ELDER A]\NRed Hair and Whitebeard?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.40,0:14:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVY HQ GUY]\NYes. Red Hair made contact.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.20,0:14:23.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ELDER A]\NThat is disturbing.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.80,0:14:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assume he didn't go himself?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVY HQ GUY]\NNo. He sent one of his crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.13,0:14:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elder, I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These two working together\Ncould mean real trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the rest of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.64,0:14:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, but let's wait for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.42,0:14:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They haven't done anything yet,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.62,0:14:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and Red Hair isn't the type\Nto act unless he's provoked.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We'll keep an eye on them,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.22,0:14:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but I'm afraid we have more\Npressing worries to tend to.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.27,0:14:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We need to focus on\Nthe Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}With Crocodile gone, we are\Nin need of a replacement.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates they may be, the\NWarlords keep things balanced.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.01,0:14:54.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With one of their number gone,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we may encounter\Nserious problems.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What plans have we made so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVY HQ GUY]\NSir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.39,0:15:03.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've called all of the Warlords\Nto Marie Jois for a meeting,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.07,0:15:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but there's no way to know\Nhow many of them will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,actually show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are pirates, after all.\NThey do as they please.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.17,0:15:10.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Crocodile.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.47,0:15:13.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's because of you\Nthat we're in this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.41,0:15:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let the pirates that\Ndefeated him go unpunished.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to retaliate swiftly.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want all of our energy\Nconcentrated on finding
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[NAVAL OFFICER]\NNavy\NHeadquarters to Marie Jois:
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.02,0:15:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Announcing the arrival\Nof Warlords
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.92,0:15:35.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Donquixote Doflamingo\Nand Bartholomew Kuma.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER B]\NWhat the...? Hey, stop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not me! I don't\Nknow what's going on.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time\Nfor your stupid pranks.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no prank.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.66,0:15:57.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like something's moving my\Nhands and I can't stop them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.\NI can't breathe!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.87,0:16:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER C]\NStop it! What\Nthe devil are you fools doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER B]\NAre you trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.27,0:16:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER A]\NLook, I told you, it's not me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER A]\NGet off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER A]\NGet off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.93,0:16:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]\NThis is your doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you find this\Nentertaining, Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOFLAMINGO]\NHm. Yes, actually.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.27,0:16:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'd like to\Nget this little shindig started
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sometime in the near future.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.34,0:16:23.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless you haven't had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.16,0:16:28.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER B]\NYou idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.02,0:16:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nyou're doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER C]\NThis foolishness has gone on
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,long enough, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:35.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NStop! Enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no time for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.30,0:16:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now sit down. There are\Npressing matters to discuss.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I apologize for\Nthe late welcome.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.75,0:16:53.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming,\Nscum of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.22,0:16:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So thoughtful of you, using\Nmy formal title like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.71,0:16:58.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NLet's begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.71,0:17:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt any more of the\NWarlords plan to attend.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.34,0:17:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, two out of six\Nis more than I expected.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.54,0:17:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOFLAMINGO]\NSmart man.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.68,0:17:07.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't plan to come either,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.68,0:17:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but the business back\Nhome's going so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it practically runs itself,\Nso I took a vacation.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.86,0:17:17.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ended up here out\Nof sheer boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not applauding\Nyour business success.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that,\Nfor the rest of us,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there are few things\Nmore distressing
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.46,0:17:24.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than a booming pirate industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.13,0:17:30.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While I admire a man who's\Nnot afraid to speak his mind,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.60,0:17:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would remember, Admiral,\Nthat there are limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[footsteps]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.61,0:17:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK]\NSo good to hear your\Ndulcet tones again, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.09,0:17:45.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you, Admiral Sengoku,\NI hope you've been well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAVAL OFFICER A]\NHawk‐Eye!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must say,\NI've never understood
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,why the Seven Warlords\Nand the Marines
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,insist on pretending\Nthey get along,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but perhaps you\Ncan enlighten me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hawk‐Eye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this little get‐together\Nwill be interesting after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What brings you here, Mihawk?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.67,0:18:02.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard about your meeting
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and thought I might\Nsit in on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have an interest in the\Npirates you'll be discussing,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'd like to stay informed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.32,0:18:10.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.05,0:18:13.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAFFITTE]\NForgive the intrusion,\Nbut if Hawk‐Eye's staying,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:16.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,perhaps you won't mind adding\None more to the party.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will tell you though,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.61,0:18:21.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my intentions are a bit\Nless passive than his are.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you, exactly?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.85,0:18:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And how'd you get\Nin here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LAFFITTE]\NQuite a prestigious group you've assembled\Nhere, Admiral. I'm truly impressed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I might join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAFFITTE]\NI heard the\Nnews about Crocodile.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.72,0:18:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a terrible shame he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for you, I've come\Nhere to offer a solution
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to your little problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"The Six Warlords"\Njust doesn't have
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.75,0:18:54.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the same ring to it, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:57.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know him! That man's Laffitte!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's Laffitte?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah‐ha. Someone here has\Nheard my name before.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd have thought it\Nhad been forgotten.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.57,0:19:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, he was\Na respected peace officer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the West Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.27,0:19:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He disappeared after a scandal\Nruined his reputation.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.71,0:19:13.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAFFITTE]\NGlad to see\Nyou're so well‐informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:17.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who I am doesn't matter.\NAll that's in the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}I've come here to talk to\Nyou about another man.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}One who I believe would make
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.27,0:19:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)}an excellent addition\Nto the Warlords.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITEBEARD]\NShanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.88,0:19:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that\Nname in a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.22,0:19:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, after all these years,\Nhe's sent me a letter?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and whatever it\Nsays must be important
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or else he wouldn't have chosen\Nme to deliver it for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITEBEARD]\NI see. You're high\Nup on the food chain, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, not exactly.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean I am still new\Nto the Red‐Haired Pirates...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's not like this\Nis my first pirate gig.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been around for a while,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.25,0:19:53.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm pretty sure I've\Nmade a name for myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys have heard about
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that famous pirate\Nnamed Rockstar, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh‐uh. I've never\Nheard of him before.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.79,0:20:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[paper ripping]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:07.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.36,0:20:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITEBEARD]\NHe sent me a letter?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.69,0:20:11.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When did that kid\Nbecome so important
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.73,0:20:15.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that he thought it would be\Nokay to send me a letter?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to take him down a notch.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROCKSTAR]\NWait! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?\NThat was an important letter.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is Shanks you're\Ndealing with...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.23,0:20:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the leader of the\NRed‐Haired Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You forget, I'm\NCaptain Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain, it's time for\Nyour medicine again.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.76,0:20:37.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITEBEARD]\NI've got all the\Nmedicine I need right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.43,0:20:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now silence! Fetch\Nme another keg!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.63,0:20:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you know my boss will\Nhear about all of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.30,0:20:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WHITEBEARD]\NDon't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.37,0:20:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I already have\Na pretty good idea
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.47,0:20:48.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of what the letter's about.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.95,0:20:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's worried about\NBlackbeard and that kid Ace.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell Shanks that if\Nhe wants to talk,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.56,0:20:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he can come see me himself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, why don't you take off?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.63,0:21:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm too busy to talk to\Na snot‐nosed rookie.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run home to your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:16.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.91,0:21:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NThe old man\Nhasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ROCKSTAR]\NHow are you\Nlaughing at this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:23.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:27.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I figured that would happen.\NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROCKSTAR]\NJust give me\Na little bit more time.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.37,0:21:31.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I promise, I can\Nstraighten this guy out.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.97,0:21:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[SHANKS]\NI don't know what you\Nplanned to do, my friend,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.71,0:21:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but forget about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.31,0:21:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You did a good job.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.31,0:21:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now just get yourself\Nback to base, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.53,0:21:41.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ROCKSTAR]\NB‐But what about my pride?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to show\Nthis guy who I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.92,0:21:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, your life is more important\Nto me than your pride.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.69,0:21:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, there's nothin' more\Nfor you to do out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.97,0:21:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we have some things to plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.81,0:21:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what're we\Ngoing to do, boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.81,0:21:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're going. Prepare\Nto set sail, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.61,0:22:00.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're going to see Whitebeard?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.79,0:22:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NSure am.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.79,0:22:03.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even you can't think the\Ngovernment won't react
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.83,0:22:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you pull a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:08.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Beckman,\NI fully expect them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:12.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.66,0:22:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to worry\Nabout the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before much longer, they'll be\Nthe ones worrying about us.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You heard him, men.\NLet's get goin'!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.87,0:22:26.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, boys. Let's get some\Ngrog ready to take with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:29.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SENGOKU]\NTeach?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.85,0:22:30.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.99,0:22:33.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the captain of the pirate\Ncrew to which I belong.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.95,0:22:35.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, if I've\Nnever heard of him,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.85,0:22:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what use is he to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.37,0:22:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With no reputation,\Nhe would pose no threat.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.11,0:22:43.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAFFITTE]\NYou know, I thought\Nyou might feel that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.51,0:22:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I assure you, we need\Nonly a little bit more time.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.51,0:22:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are drawing up a\Nplan at the moment
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.91,0:22:49.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that should take\Ncare of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOFLAMINGO laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.06,0:22:52.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOFLAMINGO]\NWell, he's\Ncaught my interest anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.02,0:22:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't we give\Nhim a try, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOFLAMINGO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:22:59.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The crew I belong to is known\Nas the Blackbeard Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.85,0:23:02.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suggest that you\Nremember that name.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.66,0:23:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN C]\NHey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone beat up Bellamy earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.38,0:23:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN D]\NWhat? Who could do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TEACH]\NThis kid looked too bright‐eyed
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.71,0:23:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to even be worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.82,0:23:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But 100 million?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.81,0:23:26.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what's our next\Nmove, Captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.29,0:23:30.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kid just got lucky...\Nhe's not really worth that much.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.52,0:23:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you throw that away\Nbefore I do it for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.16,0:23:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TEACH]\NThat's enough outta you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.93,0:23:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that oughta shut him up.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.91,0:23:46.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was looking for someone with a\Nbounty that was worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.15,0:23:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The crew's going to be rich\Nsoon, boys. Very stinkin' rich.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.84,0:23:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to hear!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.29,0:23:56.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's about time that we all\Nhad full pockets again.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.80,0:23:58.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.85,0:24:01.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weren't we meeting up\Nwith Laffitte in Mock Town?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.24,0:24:03.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him\Naround anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.11,0:24:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll just have\Nto leave without him.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.94,0:24:11.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let a bounty\Nlike that get away.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I right, Augur?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.82,0:24:16.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.89,0:24:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good Idea. We gotta do all\Nthe livin' we can right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.16,0:24:31.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Death comes for everyone\Nsome time, even pirates.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=29}===============================DIALOGUE============================
